('Coordinator','IE',"All four walks are free, but places are limited because large groups can block narrow pavements. Collect a coloured ticket at the registration desk for the route you want. Please take only one ticket per person. If you later change your mind, return it so someone else can use the place. Booking a place on a walk does not reserve a seat at the evening discussion; that has a separate ticket."),
('Coordinator','IE',"A few practical matters now. The printed map shows toilets inside the sports centre, but that building is closed today. Please use the public toilets behind the theatre. Drinking water is available here in the courtyard, so fill your bottle before leaving. There are no refreshments included on the routes. Some pass cafés, but the guides won't make a scheduled stop for buying food."),
